       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CUSTFMT.
      * FORMATS ONE CUSTOMER AS A REPORT LINE (STATIC CALL)
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-BAL-ED              PIC -(7)9.99.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  LK-REC.
           COPY CUSTREC.
       01  LK-LINE                PIC X(60).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-REC LK-LINE.
       0000-FORMAT.
           MOVE SPACES TO LK-LINE
           MOVE CUST-BAL TO WS-BAL-ED
           STRING CUST-ID '-' CUST-NAME ' ' WS-BAL-ED
               DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO LK-LINE
           GOBACK.
